  "description": "Use the Chat node with the Chat Trigger node to send messages into the chat and optionally wait for responses from users. This enables human-in-the-loop (HITL) use cases in chat workflows, allowing you to have multiple chat interactions within a single execution. The Chat node also works as a tool for AI Agents",
  "doc_url": "https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-langchain.chat",
